# Angular CLI / ng-packagr build caches and intermediates
.angular
out-tsc

# recursica.json and the recursica_*.{css,json} theme files ARE checked in — see
# docs/CREATING_AN_ADAPTER.md. @recursica/official-release's postinstall script
# generates them into the project root on first `npm install`; that generated
# state is committed so the repo has a reviewable, versioned copy of the design
# tokens it's building against, and so a fresh clone doesn't need a fresh
# `npm install` to have them present. Do NOT add them here.

*storybook.log
storybook-static

# compodoc output that @storybook/angular's storybook/build-storybook
# architect targets (angular.json) regenerate on every run via
# `compodoc: true`/`compodocArgs` — a build artifact, not source.
projects/adapter-angular-material/documentation.json

# `adapter-tester` (the CLI) regenerates a throwaway Playwright config/harness under
# .adapter-tester/ on every run, and writes its own report/results dirs
.adapter-tester/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Ephemeral verification screenshots/scripts (e.g. ad-hoc Playwright checks
# during development) — never meant to be committed. Nothing previously
# excluded this, which is how a batch of them ended up committed in "First
# rev of all components" and had to be cleaned up later.
.scratch/
